1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:01,350
DEV: Batteries. Now.

2
00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:03,139
MIRA: Remote first.

3
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:05,226
DEV: It doesn't even work without them!

4
00:00:05,526 --> 00:00:07,240
MIRA: Then why are you holding it?

5
00:00:08,540 --> 00:00:10,014
DEV: You could just let go.

6
00:00:10,264 --> 00:00:11,395
MIRA: You first.

7
00:00:17,445 --> 00:00:18,941
JO: It has a button.

8
00:00:20,471 --> 00:00:21,871
That's a deadlock.

9
00:00:21,871 --> 00:00:23,681
Each one holds what the other needs,

10
00:00:23,681 --> 00:00:25,601
so both wait forever.

11
00:00:25,601 --> 00:00:27,581
It's one reason apps freeze.
